    "notes": [
      "GCP raw and rewritten child keys are unchanged from v0.0.101 (google_cloud.rs).",
      "0.1.x hands every provider environment value that is not a static credential to children as its raw value (non-secret classification, grpc/policy.rs and provider_credentials.rs), so raw provider keys are not a fixed list; mcp-config-transaction.py therefore also requires the named variable to hold an OpenShell placeholder in the transaction's own environment.",
      "Endpoint-bound credentials resolve only through revisioned (v<n>_) or stable-handle (s<64 hex>_) placeholders (secrets.rs resolve_placeholder); both prefixes are a reserved namespace.",
      "runtimeControlKeys adds the raw, non-secret names observed in a live 0.1.7 Hermes workload that the v0.0.101 list did not cover."
    ]
